# Style rules for `just lint`. Each line is
#   <git pathspecs> :: <words separated by spaces> :: <message>
# A word is forbidden where it occurs as a whole word outside comments and string literals.
theories :: Class Instance Instances Canonical :: Typeclasses and canonical structures are not used. Write a module type and a functor.
theories :: Print Check Compute About Locate Search SearchPattern SearchRewrite SearchHead Show :: Query commands do not belong in theories.
theories tests examples :: admit give_up Abort :: These leave a proof unfinished.
# Sentence-level R13 checks run in just/r13.awk: module types in Include, Declare Module,
# data in functors, module ascription, _TIME parameters and unqualified Require.
